<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Best Buy said downgraded [CORRECTED 21:48 GMT].</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Best Buy said downgraded [CORRECTED 21:48 GMT].</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs lowered its recommendation on Best Buy Co Inc to market outperform from trading buy, according to a Goldman source.</p>
<p>(Corrects previous rating to trading buy from buy).</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
